{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/reviews/id588520073"}, "name":{"label":"ikkioroi"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-10-20T10:59:40-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.2026.279"}, "id":{"label":"14690255074"}, "title":{"label":"Making Reading Enjoyable Again"}, "content":{"label":"I wanted to share some genuine appreciation for the latest ChatGPT iOS app update.\n\nThe improvements to typography, font size, and text layout have made a surprisingly big difference in my experience. The responses feel more cohesive and natural to read, almost like well-written articles rather than fragmented blocks of text that require endless scrolling.\n\nThe interface now makes it easier to stay focused, follow complex arguments, and absorb information without losing the thread of a conversation. More meaningful content fits on the screen at once, yet everything remains clear, readable, and thoughtfully organized.\n\nWhat I find especially exciting is the bigger picture: this kind of interface could help bring back the pleasure of long-form reading. In a world dominated by short videos, endless feeds, and fragmented attention, ChatGPT offers something different — an opportunity to slow down, explore ideas in depth, ask questions along the way, and genuinely understand what you’re reading.\n\nIt feels like a new form of reading: interactive, conversational, and adapted to the way people naturally learn.\n\nThank you to everyone on the team who contributed to these improvements. They may seem like small design decisions individually, but together they make the product significantly more enjoyable and useful. I noticed the difference immediately after updating the app, and it has genuinely strengthened my confidence in continuing my subscription.\n\nPlease pass this feedback along to the team responsible for the iOS experience. I’d love for them to know that their work is making a real difference for users.\n\nKeep up the excellent work!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/review?id=6448311069&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
